Includes Blitz, AnyRender, Vello CPU, and the Kition SDK. vendor/ holds modified copies of
Blitz (blitz-dom, blitz-html, blitz-paint and blitz-vibey-script at revision
21edc92d90d8f8bedadd3f9ecb14b1ad950952eb), Boa's parser, Glifo, Parley, Stylo and Vello CPU,
each with its upstream license files; vendor/README.md lists every changed file, and
docs/attribution.md each copy's source and license. The package includes dependency
licenses in engine/licenses/ and the bundled Inter font's OFL in fonts/.

Loro (https://github.com/loro-dev/loro), Copyright (c) 2023 Zixuan Chen, is under the MIT License
(below). The engine links its Rust crates (loro 1.16.2, through kition-sdk's Loro dependency in
kition-kdm) from KitionPkg/loro (https://github.com/KitionPkg/loro, MIT, revision c0f64d39: upstream
Loro at 45708d05 with a persistent map of its own in place of the MPL-2.0 im), so no MPL-2.0 crate
comes with Loro in the engine. The editor bundles Loro as loro-crdt 1.16.4 (the upstream build,
through @kition/kit-editor), which contains the MPL-2.0 crates im, sized-chunks and bitmaps listed
below.

